ext": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:48:15", "owner": "rnia.espresso", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17903002140253403, "text": "@chahalysa_", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:15:40", "owner": "zulgaf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17965746875966429, "text": "わかりやすい!", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:34:52", "owner": "yuu_nana21", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069239078325858, "text": "This one's pretty obvious", "created_at": "2025-09-05T00:12:52", "owner": "zen_baudi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076902413046656, "text": "Guys, what is this for?? If anyone can explain it to me, I would appreciate it.\n🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-23T21:18:07", "owner": "ryan_49bjj", "likes": 84}, {"id": 18057601046322533, "text": "Оохх этот звук🥰🥰", "created_at": "2025-12-16T15:43:35", "owner": "with_aitaazhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525192313067665, "text": "@claudii.ve 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:19:16", "owner": "maexfell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18443923810096592, "text": "Wait like actually thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:11:29", "owner": "twodollie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843824434625612, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:35:48", "owner": "iriangel._.mp16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062587727196524, "text": "دلیل ؟", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:37:03", "owner": "hamed_h20000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084891248092843, "text": "No...wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:32:31", "owner": "lived2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058857962282440, "text": "Time for cream milk?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:02:22", "owner": "kuriakostsanikidis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154638091411847, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:00:50", "owner": "metallbauschlosser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916748749224264, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:12:14", "owner": "ximenanakamoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927728956164293, "text": "If you know how to make it you can put it wherever you want", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:24:00", "owner": "kostas_antoniads", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911942911255971, "text": "@cochibahar", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:02:24", "owner": "shlomyshirazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077032501957312, "text": "@keliiin_soto", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:46:16", "owner": "bajoperfilwhisky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177452623363675, "text": "@wahyusrya  oke mani byin latihan", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:10:17", "owner": "kumis_jahatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164105926376924, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:38:02", "owner": "kevin_huang0820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031861706750301, "text": "@alexfe_42", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:33:44", "owner": "azansuryadin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862377928522510, "text": "Ang galling naman", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:56:27", "owner": "makie_alivio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948359932053331, "text": "Men hvor lenge holder du med melken????", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:48:00", "owner": "brankagut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041775596703624, "text": "عالی بود", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:35:16", "owner": "nonard.cafebakery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427298605129805, "text": "Oooooh finalmente 🙌🙌🙌🙌 grazie. La so fare ma mi piace migliorare dove e quando posso. Finalmente qualcuno che lo spiega visivamente e maniera facile", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:21:03", "owner": "luanasimone5.12.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009571688641904, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:08:29", "owner": "rikosaputra337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094371754832407, "text": "Stemerr foam", "created_at": "2025-11-04T16:26:47", "owner": "pancaalhaidrah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384001423178598, "text": "@doth_dan", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:00:18", "owner": "diegocorvea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847912657594050, "text": "Dovreste ricordare ai barman che la tazzina per il cappuccino e per il caffè si prende per il manico , non si prendono con la loro intera mano in tutte le altre parti della tazzina dove dopo i clienti ci poggiano la bocca per bere quanto ordinato - IGIENE - è diventata una moda quella di poggiare la propria mano su intera tazza per preparare un cappuccino o un caffè NON SI FA e si vede anche in quelli che dovrebbero essere bar di alto livello 🤷🏻‍♀️👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻👎🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:26:12", "owner": "rsc_romastudiocondominiale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061485224432397, "text": "Yo lo meto al centro y me sale cremosito", "created_at": "2025-10-29T09:17:25", "owner": "math17703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071343380585162, "text": "It’s a texture thing most don’t understand:(", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:43:11", "owner": "finchintahoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079172876030950, "text": "@arif_lukman_4  @zainuldimanamana", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:28:42", "owner": "kancil.gakngaxngex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863781691494279, "text": "😮😮👏👏👏👍👍", "created_at": "2025-10-19T23:56:42", "owner": "melody18880", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063152063126062, "text": "@juan_gm2", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:49:32", "owner": "gagoscoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062608118385701, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-07T07:17:28", "owner": "jpraihan1264", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847827724575542, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:26:43", "owner": "kaldi_cafe2000", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["فوم_گیری", "لاته", "نازل_بخار", "اسپرسوساز_صنعتی", "آموزش_قهوه", "آموزش_فوم_گیری", "لاته_آرت", "شیر_قهوه", "قهوه_آرمون", "آرمون"]},
{"media_id": 3742463592144002361, "shortcode": "DPv5s8Ck105", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPv5s8Ck105/", "taken_at": "2025-10-13T11:54:43", "caption": "Always failing at steaming milk?\nI have posted a tutorial video on YouTube with all the steps and explanations of correct and incorrect methods.\nYouTube: Mr.24 \n@lamarzoccohome \n@lamarzoccotaiwan \n\n台北拉花課程（一對一、一對二）\n完全零經驗都可以上手的課程\n\n一堂實作30次的實戰課程\n不僅體驗與聽聽理論，真正學會拉花的課程\n零經驗與初學者最適合上課\n奶泡打不好、拉花不明顯、依靠運氣\n解答所有新手常見問題\n\n11月份課程有優惠折扣！歡迎私訊報名\n\n地點：近台北捷運北門站 （走路即可）\n時段：週一至週日 9:00-12:00、14:00-17:00\n費用：1位（2.5小時2980元）2位（3小時5000）\n任何問題都可以私訊我！\n\n#lattearttutorial #latteart #coffee #latte \n#coffeeshop  #ラテアート#ラテ#咖啡 #拉花", "owner_username": "24.studio__", "owner_id": "18100255092", "likes": 182568, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0003_DPv5s8Ck105\\DPv5s8Ck105_20251013_115443.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17867578692395472, "text": "whats that for? To cool down milk?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T00:40:11", "owner": "harvinkumar1998", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18096433849687833, "text": "Flatwhite, cafe latte, cappuccino. Perfect explanation 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-18T02:00:29", "owner": "rak.kopi", "likes": 246}, {"id": 18115726618480503, "text": "20 percent is okay I think", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:07:37", "owner": "heyy__hanif", "likes": 2320}, {"id": 18161885032375974, "text": "Hay alguna forma de practicar sin usar leche??", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:04:18", "owner": "frandaure", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17914231371198957, "text": "Perfect explanation 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:30:11", "owner": "doublespresso.o", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18068905868338954, "text": "Cuál es la mejor?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T17:16:37", "owner": "mariolozano80", "likes": 240}, {"id": 17871535608361970, "text": "You never start above the milk. Even if you’re going crazy foam you start tip in and draw it out once it’s got the vortex going… do it by sound of bubbles being injected.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:18:28", "owner": "kellenchase", "likes": 938}, {"id": 18048111731354879, "text": "Which one is better?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T19:35:58", "owner": "ed_r73", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18077406008471854, "text": "👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:26:00", "owner": "nathyvalenm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17856386625492109, "text": "I burnt myself trying the last one...super hot milk exploded everywhere 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:55:00", "owner": "tiare.baeriswyl.van_gaever", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18091821424875600, "text": "@yourb0i___ bole ikut ni 😉", "created_at": "2025-10-26T12:28:49", "owner": "ez_zxuan99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139599037432808, "text": "@lylyypixie @3805privates", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:37:48", "owner": "yogiarohman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103690258623209, "text": "100% 😫", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:19:15", "owner": "0kefa", "likes": 70}, {"id": 18064425134621583, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T22:50:15", "owner": "omsocribpr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914602102198677, "text": "1 %", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:16:44", "owner": "coffee_artistcherry03", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18067565636365932, "text": "👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:34:32", "owner": "kahvelikk_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18046096268427642, "text": "When I leave so high is splashes all over why is that?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:52:42", "owner": "thinkonlyfarward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924723862141112, "text": "A video i wish i saw sooner", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:35:06", "owner": "mikdazon", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17872317249441004, "text": "@totod.07 @fadilirwnn @jayadibae_28 @jesen_bagas @marynoalto @rasky_y", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:54:32", "owner": "aji_hamid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915975925196694, "text": "Which is the best", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:24:48", "owner": "hbkrds", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18058753568205949, "text": "@jelainegalorport", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:31:11", "owner": "papabrewrista", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069361811583110, "text": "@frs1bnu @flyforfun._ @adtwcksn liat tuh yg 20% posisi nya, sama kaya yg gue bilangin kan", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:13:11", "owner": "amrypdtra", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080120126045463, "text": "Which one the best ,is't 80%", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:36:44", "owner": "epin.r.gun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17972142659959255, "text": "@li_ya_chun", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:27:33", "owner": "_li_yung_de0709", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936819949093339, "text": "Thanks man 😎👍", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:26:05", "owner": "djordjevicmanhattan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18141944851449813, "text": "200 spiegazioni diverse.. e poi bastava sto schemino 🥲🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-27T20:41:51", "owner": "yashaick", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17932400361113509, "text": "Dont do the 80%💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:38:33", "owner": "tobias_mercuri", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18096298015704414, "text": "@asyrsfn", "created_at": "2025-10-15T02:48:40", "owner": "barbargaje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303551710267757, "text": "@malakeels", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:17:45", "owner": "saraelsavali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083932925504682, "text": "This is getting out of hand", "created_at": "2025-10-14T23:38:08", "owner": "annoor.kitchen", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18298700266253269, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:34:57", "owner": "gastropoeta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18323440357241799, "text": "Flat white ka kitna pa rakha hai", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:57:51", "owner": "muk.eshkr12k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18371550568158474, "text": "@ibilly_i_can_fly  so which one is better ?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:06:20", "owner": "abby_abg14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335999587233022, "text": "What are steam does affects to milk", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:57:32", "owner": "ippai.10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18348669769161141, "text": "1% for flat white , 20% latte , 80% cappuccino 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:25:08", "owner": "mustakimmuzaini", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17982479150933326, "text": "It's about the temperature of the milk", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:13:19", "owner": "filipemsousa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518512855068310, "text": "Always failing at steaming milk? Never do the 3rd way.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:27:17", "owner": "beermentality", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214305781309825, "text": "The most beautiful sound ever", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:45:20", "owner": "5v1v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060962027555392, "text": "Such a misleading video, lmao, never do 80%", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:54:22", "owner": "zlatomir.sabriev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871932343470616, "text": "It's for what ?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:15:51", "owner": "nathan._.mln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049067003407314, "text": "🌏🎬☕️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:23:59", "owner": "andreramdani92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335371795234524, "text": "Thats a good way to get milk all over you", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:50:14", "owner": "_being_yuken_is_tough", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126940081511936, "text": "yeah i learnt this from good coffee great coffee", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:39:07", "owner": "v4ynill3a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865850785511949, "text": "How to make iced Late with steamer?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:46:37", "owner": "gaxys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112027594526338, "text": "Another video you present shows that if you leave the tip of the steamer out, it makes more foam and this one shows the opposite", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:06:48", "owner": "nela.idris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917990200214525, "text": "Which percent is perfect ?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:53:40", "owner": "miniceros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552511345002575, "text": "@renattagarnier", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:59:10", "owner": "lf_gc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078805775266670, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:15:09", "owner": "ry.a1a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535027021052573, "text": "Yang paling gampang menurutku bikin foam dl br panasin susunya kalo Klian panasin susu dulu kalo pas bikin foam kepanasan g enak", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:44:30", "owner": "disyagank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098620696775156, "text": "Nope", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:01:19", "owner": "naeemusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983713767761185, "text": "Wat", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:27:51", "owner": "christiansawesome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029639111745647, "text": "Where do you find 80% milk? I wanna see that cow", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:10:32", "owner": "mmucharz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930903100129699, "text": "Wie warm ist die Milch nach dem schäumen?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:36:35", "owner": "miggfrei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329207908215555, "text": "Well I’ve been doing it wrong.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:39:45", "owner": "squearl_format", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015172235803551, "text": "Es muy complicado, mantener el equilibrio sobre al ras de la leche,  casi siempre se hunde un poco, y se llena de burbujas.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:34:24", "owner": "ricooblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118377454554007, "text": "Damn. I read \"how to steal\"", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:58:17", "owner": "_santiago.quesada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913163794235721, "text": "The milk and pitcher must be very cold", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:44:55", "owner": "fairuzyusoff1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417942052118036, "text": "Ragazzi non guardate questo video sono cazzate quelle che vedete", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:38:54", "owner": "gior.do", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326114794208552, "text": "It depends on the amount of air you put in the milk not the angle", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:53:50", "owner": "ukrainianpirate24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292194442277974, "text": "This is where the process of milk aeration which creates foam and whirlpooling causes heating comes in place.☕", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:40:15", "owner": "aarisonrebello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087594796907525, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:25:49", "owner": "raj.parmarr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364177813095385, "text": "... 3 and a half years... THREE AND A HALF YEARS and I just saw this... It's a masterpiece... Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:52:13", "owner": "mrfray2409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192562462331913, "text": "Now I get it I can't speak mandarin 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:22:37", "owner": "mfauzzan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102480895731247, "text": "lowkey i just listen to the vibes of the milk", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:13:51", "owner": "supersourraspberriez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113999710562830, "text": "1%", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:14:28", "owner": "jk_boss_94_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378004255150338, "text": "Omg this makes sense", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:55:34", "owner": "zxina_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928002346138492, "text": "For the first time finally someone showing this!🙌 thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:39:33", "owner": "zaffronacoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018987038609134, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:29:10", "owner": "umut.selimogluu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064285163382866, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:18:37", "owner": "_m1dle_sect1on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059610107233128, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:54:20", "owner": "mokanocoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907585138256691, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:57:12", "owner": "smaillbensalem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539065003039500, "text": "Kmmn1", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:40:39", "owner": "ridwanrsdy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085230205988321, "text": "Please help - I only ever have to steam milk for one. Is 160ml milk  too little because I  end up with great foam but it all gets mixed in when I first pour in the milk and then I have nothing at the end.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:36:20", "owner": "rnrgbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088989316916098, "text": "🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-01T04:28:28", "owner": "dioniss_ds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112846522563743, "text": "Oh~ nice modeling", "created_at": "2025-10-27T20:45:28", "owner": "ik_tte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871102978450178, "text": "Gw pikir itu buat nambahin susu nya pas dulu wkwk", "created_at": "2025-10-27T14:38:34", "owner": "ardiansyah__1112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102221521561805, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-10-26T15:20:05", "owner": "calvinuts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334156069225351, "text": "Last one will definitely spray hot milk and water everywhere, just bob the pitcher up and down until its foamy how you want it", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:55:17", "owner": "weathergl0w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145931650426143, "text": "stopped of course he is work like that", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:53:46", "owner": "adeldeliodev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193120711324424, "text": "Use the MilkPal from @marcobeveragesystems 😉", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:10:04", "owner": "lucahutten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070720691243343, "text": "And what option is correct", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:20:05", "owner": "yevhen.vep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076366346332204, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:16:25", "owner": "buicu94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141276049434045, "text": "this is so stupid:)))))", "created_at": "2025-10-20T08:41:25", "owner": "beeedibles4200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295395691257773, "text": "@ilhamnzhf_", "created_at": "2025-10-19T03:23:52", "owner": "maulana_alfaino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075317857934745, "text": "Bro it’s too much air omg", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:43:27", "owner": "trulydonmarco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091913983882793, "text": "Plis mo tanya hrga nya berp ya itu", "created_at": "2025-10-18T22:01:36", "owner": "yullmba_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093325156837521, "text": "Guys just try in real life u will figure it out by yourself... this video is 🐃💩", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:07:34", "owner": "mr_d_pop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953426970892276, "text": "👏🤭😊", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:57:17", "owner": "waroenksoesoerully", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112858789484404, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:33:18", "owner": "e.a.lashgari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074959865323797, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:34:07", "owner": "aka__saint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962789238840617, "text": "@son__tae", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:16:58", "owner": "imdongh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053034350645632, "text": "i don't get it", "created_at": "2025-10-17T20:24:27", "owner": "groverio.fdz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054484994287764, "text": "Good illustration!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T07:38:28", "owner": "just.brew.coffees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527836378040524, "text": "20% is fine, right? What temperature do you think is best for milk?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:46:11", "owner": "shigeyukiyoshida4923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067807775354442, "text": "u need to gradually raise the tip to get more foam, if u just put it above th surface u will get big bubble and bad texture", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:38:45", "owner": "gusdhesewana_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100324117648548, "text": "Goood tip", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:11:01", "owner": "seymur.ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923999668149389, "text": "@_ebywangg", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:31:07", "owner": "ajengko12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099762094631037, "text": "@nauvalrmdhn._ 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:28:45", "owner": "berlyfrmnsyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175620856355633, "text": "Good coffee, great coffee in real life", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:14:17", "owner": "wtf_01100110_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069332942257380, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:51:25", "owner": "ku__fitness__coach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056040059539641, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:50:44", "owner": "amin_chopani128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021702380777366, "text": "Last one creates bubbles, bubbles no good", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:50:15", "owner": "zankz_meech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977500071930506, "text": "Whats the percentage about? Distance from the bottom of the jug?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:50:07", "owner": "leicht_angeniced", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092507668871340, "text": "Del 1% e ir subiendo", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:13:50", "owner": "josue98priv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425976226108900, "text": "good teach", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:21:42", "owner": "_i.a.r.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982122027874738, "text": "Thanks!!!! Im a visual person and this is everything i need", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:23:37", "owner": "sarrahaladdin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936277654093432, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:23:29", "owner": "syepri7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072019573986744, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:08:02", "owner": "isme2807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130169518467412, "text": "p", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:56:33", "owner": "edlikk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887930212244725, "text": "🔥🔥Awesome", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:36:05", "owner": "jackson432574", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024569498755223, "text": "Its a perfect presentation of how to create milk steaming 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:26:53", "owner": "thecoffeeartistco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098306935710050, "text": "Uff tremendo dato", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:10:19", "owner": "lujofer09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382727941178580, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:09:54", "owner": "harislangsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887911729240129, "text": "Obviously some uni student working part time during studies did it😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T23:17:16", "owner": "mash_c._thomson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861365728508470, "text": "@llanos1197", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:14:44", "owner": "maru.vedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073009189949578, "text": "You gonna burn the milk in 3", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:13:46", "owner": "sirajz.ismail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842057692600357, "text": "❤️❤️👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-14T19:11:44", "owner": "suniljohn3719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528982909055785, "text": "@arif_lukman_4", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:13:16", "owner": "kancil.gakngaxngex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896411938182763, "text": "@adammmmmmmmmm.m", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:25:18", "owner": "adelutfi86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409188928141313, "text": "@ridwan_setiawan21", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:13:00", "owner": "ungarthegreat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899073352163655, "text": "easy", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:48:51", "owner": "q_hpq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911564368235335, "text": "@ditooas", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:48:19", "owner": "fatchurrizal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088891795921221, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:12:34", "owner": "lodk4400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897174634308297, "text": "Flat white, Latte & Cappuccino", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:00:30", "owner": "rdnksyfllh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071061539213801, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:22:15", "owner": "__ooooooooooz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17918700585188798, "text": "Can you pls elaborate on this thank you", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:11:42", "owner": "cocktailgalore_by_steph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045055181406577, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:21:30", "owner": "las_abdulsalam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077247920279751, "text": "@jess.marie05", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:23:07", "owner": "hasbeanz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989286849853606, "text": "Thank You, may God Bless You ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:21:08", "owner": "wlelelle_l_e", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["lattearttutorial", "latteart", "coffee", "latte", "coffeeshop", "ラテアート", "ラテ", "咖啡", "拉花"]},
{"media_id": 3790923198167278569, "shortcode": "DScEJBFjGPp", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DScEJBFjGPp/", "taken_at": "2025-12-19T08:35:01", "caption": "💡 搞流量不如搞人性！ 💭✨\n💡 反差萌！ 实体引流 ➡️ 提升顧客體驗 🛍✨\n\n#反差 #實體引流 #短視頻運營 #顧客體驗 #開店必讀 #人性營銷\n追蹤 @dreampush.lab 創業成功學", "owner_username": "dreampush.lab", "owner_id": "78106305168", "likes": 37, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0004_DScEJBFjGPp\\DScEJBFjGPp_20251219_083501.mp4"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["反差", "實體引流", "短視頻運營", "顧客體驗", "開店必讀", "人性營銷"]},
{"media_id": 3786652618652309945, "shortcode": "DSM5H5-ktm5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSM5H5-ktm5/", "taken_at": "2025-12-13T11:11:21", "caption": "iPhone17PRO長焦鏡頭拍的豆花看起來好好吃\n\n悠呼豆花\n📞(03)9330332\n📍宜蘭市復興路一段100號", "owner_username": "uuuhoo.douhua", "owner_id": "73708039229", "likes": 6725, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0005_DSM5H5-ktm5\\DSM5H5-ktm5_20251213_111121.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18066353045402549, "text": "我有點懷疑 但我沒有證據", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:23:49", "owner": "yilanpov", "likes": 871}, {"id": 18085313204476384, "text": "為什麼你的17特別不一樣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:56:43", "owner": "imyesman", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18114544219579470, "text": "這是往後走吧ww", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:44:58", "owner": "yan._.100937", "likes": 446}, {"id": 17954448996046510, "text": "感覺只差沒被車撞到而已", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:44:28", "owner": "anuangryfire", "likes": 103}, {"id": 17947542714076189, "text": "碰到葉子了", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:48:53", "owner": "huangguanlin6279", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17874053034463493, "text": "我懷疑偷偷業配", "created_at": "2025-12-14T03:31:31", "owner": "_7uuo._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084516170119650, "text": "可惜沒有防手震", "created_at": "2025-12-14T02:03:42", "owner": "a62181234567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032596820753448, "text": "我覺得這不是極限", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:54:03", "owner": "gtr98121", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18074661599028985, "text": "我相信是因為手太抖了吧", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:50:15", "owner": "owenliao0526", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18101627218751021, "text": "只看到丁丁藥局", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:38:12", "owner": "howard__kkwqcaef", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086324531095437, "text": "店員應該熱了ㄛ~🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:07:59", "owner": "s._.miy791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132973840493221, "text": "Pro 還是Bro", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:33:16", "owner": "wyc._.819", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18544250404057275, "text": "……😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:01:30", "owner": "wuyuxiang281", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842303386662658, "text": "影片倒放", "created_at": "2025-12-14T09:51:56", "owner": "wusam0506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081231533139513, "text": "最後是自己往後走", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:47:26", "owner": "lam_handsome", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087598784006683, "text": "我以為他是要往後走再放大，看了評論：噢 原來是在假裝可以拉很近", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:24:18", "owner": "reana_o7o7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122066785548294, "text": "是不是還有偷用廣角", "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:58:05", "owner": "yiqianc17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080734390928500, "text": "呃……😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:19:06", "owner": "blackpink_jisoo_i_love_you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134028097491051, "text": "不過有點晃就是了", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:27:30", "owner": "fir._.09.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105419434638461, "text": "哩阿木叫你回家吃飯", "created_at": "2025-12-15T07:27:12", "owner": "wrap_john", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858265894511869, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-12-14T13:38:32", "owner": "xn._1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024965690717196, "text": "一眼假谢谢", "created_at": "2025-12-14T21:41:25", "owner": "kyh_1272", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3760344686427669253, "shortcode": "DQvbZGzjIMF", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQvbZGzjIMF/", "taken_at": "2025-11-07T04:01:07", "caption": "#GQ娛樂 Sydney Sweeney 分享拍攝《高校十八禁》的幕後趣事：「我偷走很多件凱希的牛仔褲！」\n\n#SydneySweeney #高校十八禁 @sydney_sweeney", "owner_username": "gqtaiwan", "owner_id": "1371344513", "likes": 31175, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0006_DQvbZGzjIMF\\DQvbZGzjIMF_20251107_040107.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18098617942743072, "text": "明明笑容就很甜美可愛了，評論區都在討論她的身材…", "created_at": "2025-11-11T03:31:47", "owner": "saminga_z", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18093036097842280, "text": "她這段話很有哲理跟智慧，必須多看幾次才能看懂。", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:43:37", "owner": "justyin999", "likes": 792}, {"id": 18072476411353680, "text": "字幕誰做的？請開除他 謝謝", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:54:16", "owner": "fxxk0502", "likes": 3585}, {"id": 17944650530942449, "text": "我們可以告訴她頭髮很棒嗎，這樣她就可以保留它了。 我不再喜歡她了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T21:47:46", "owner": "cantrushtalent", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17875464621437095, "text": "那個字幕可不可以往下移一點", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:59:24", "owner": "khh831", "likes": 760}, {"id": 18089626351915521, "text": "我聽得懂英文，我不需要字幕。請把字幕拿掉再上傳一次😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:08:43", "owner": "mr.yang420", "likes": 106}, {"id": 18201901402316635, "text": "字幕可以關掉不", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:44:04", "owner": "maddox.520", "likes": 654}, {"id": 18082042133020803, "text": "問題：她穿什麼顏色的衣服", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:37:16", "owner": "chanchihihihin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921105244188645, "text": "還敢提牛仔褲啊😏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T03:19:48", "owner": "chen.jhen", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17977105937936579, "text": "問題來了 在座的男性她偷拿什麼？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:21:37", "owner": "mr.beanbean.man", "likes": 119}, {"id": 18156537655367015, "text": "她說什麼🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:46:43", "owner": "lun180_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18080304938165579, "text": "留言區好好笑", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:02:50", "owner": "pinrenchen", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17901037131162171, "text": "我覺得她說得對", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:06:25", "owner": "chang__3.14159", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876219961431567, "text": "中忍考試失敗☹️", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:40:53", "owner": "tjy_0113", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18055856780307940, "text": "沒有人會注意到妳的牛仔褲過長", "created_at": "2025-11-12T05:56:58", "owner": "yuchanchung8211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866490724413489, "text": "她說的很有道理 我也覺得地球是平的", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:20:30", "owner": "tim_7ozeem15", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17930273838128859, "text": "字幕非常沒水準 嚴厲斥責", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:14:26", "owner": "llsaintgabriell", "likes": 46}, {"id": 17856033999558251, "text": "所以要演貓女 偷別人東西", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:51:38", "owner": "yujochan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18227465755305857, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:28:45", "owner": "_l00kskilla_", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18081542834032146, "text": "她的牛仔褲好飽滿 我是說她的胸部很適合 不是我是說 唉算了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:04:47", "owner": "xun_7.24", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17953113714041860, "text": "一小時了 放我走..", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:38:08", "owner": "fifee0800", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17858357484542594, "text": "我覺得沒有字幕應該也能聽懂\n\n請不要多事好嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:06:00", "owner": "starkchu", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17903767788145680, "text": "我觉得那个字母是多余的", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:02:24", "owner": "readyplayer_mj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978943380776869, "text": "Fire the subtitles placement guy", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:03:40", "owner": "gucciolives", "likes": 212}, {"id": 17931657003108237, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:33:42", "owner": "wendyztb", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092531191861411, "text": "原来会英语这么重要。。。只能盯着字幕", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:42:22", "owner": "jonlography", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18365432233082160, "text": "第一次這麼討厭字幕", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:05:36", "owner": "pi20010607", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18332928655209489, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:46:52", "owner": "u_n_d_