es": 0}, {"id": 18336732712235937, "text": "你慘啦，去街嗰度咁搞你老婆返去要跪荷蘭水蓋，跟住好後欄俾啲嘢食個榴槤你就慘啦！但係你老婆好似話得幾開心。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:22:48", "owner": "jintaole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094094794913124, "text": "四眼妹幾靚。。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:41:05", "owner": "mak4896", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075734441206984, "text": "Talk 💩", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:56:15", "owner": "michele_baby_lovely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906587266143043, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:46:27", "owner": "xc.yochaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886230406283779, "text": "就怕大伯突然来一句：靓女你又换人了？", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:34:19", "owner": "alanyeager97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084976736107884, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:59:20", "owner": "alex.ho.1229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890735074388626, "text": "😂😂😂👍👍👍 这类型搞笑, 想学学! 但真的学不到, 学不会!! 🤣🤣🤣😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:20:23", "owner": "limchrischris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855479755579931, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:08:03", "owner": "ling_csl222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105758695634134, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:38:00", "owner": "f0970166707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854721580588554, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:57:01", "owner": "racekwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954039534908182, "text": "Stupid prank that degrade the wife, no respect no love just to achieve his prank on video 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:28:16", "owner": "winsonkhong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857669785512680, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:08:35", "owner": "jonathanlieu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517123348069615, "text": "靓女我老婆翻乡下啦🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:02:06", "owner": "10.46760059", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085651976047856, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:05:53", "owner": "rubywong129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993790032852275, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:52:10", "owner": "zhanglang98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064868156532823, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:37:54", "owner": "rmsdrw300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102736966688940, "text": "賤精老公, 襯早離再揾個對你好的🫤", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:08:44", "owner": "fanningskuan", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["犯賤", "犯賤日常", "整蠱", "夫妻日常"]},
{"media_id": 3690505255693150128, "shortcode": "DM3TvoXTWew", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DM3TvoXTWew/", "taken_at": "2025-08-02T19:38:07", "caption": "創傷性事件（車禍、性侵、虐待等）發生後沒看心理醫生怎麼辦：\n寫出來-畫出來-理解-療癒-原諒-學習愛-創作\n（每個人都有最適合自己的方法）\n\n發生了什麼發生了\n發生了不代表你很無能\n強迫自己忘記只會每次想起來更痛苦\n面對真正發生的\n對自己的感受誠實\n好好的理解調整自己\n慢慢學會原諒傷害你的人\n學習如何愛自己及愛別人\n\n過程嗎？很痛苦的\n但是我走到現在很感激當時的我選擇面對這一團亂\n一切發生有原因的\n學習接受就算事實會傷人\n（也是因為過去的我現在才能跟大家講這些\n\n我知道自己承擔得很辛苦\n沒事的慢慢來🤍", "owner_username": "aurosa_a", "owner_id": "17783338058", "likes": 43401, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0014_DM3TvoXTWew\\DM3TvoXTWew_20250802_193807.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18088736311689215, "text": "我覺得妳很厲害！衷心的佩服妳的所有勇氣以及咬牙堅持住那段重生的過程  祝妳未來越來越好！😍", "created_at": "2025-08-04T17:21:04", "owner": "xxt_4677", "likes": 1014}, {"id": 18195356455312655, "text": "我也是曾經遇到過這些事情，我懂太多的鼓勵可能造成壓力，所以只想跟你說，我們都值得過上更好的生活。", "created_at": "2025-08-03T01:30:37", "owner": "weirong_2004", "likes": 1852}, {"id": 18022806611524359, "text": "谢谢你把自己从深渊拯救出来，你真的很勇敢！❤️❤️加油✨🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-08-05T16:37:48", "owner": "xinqi_tang", "likes": 218}, {"id": 18325881373230581, "text": "你跟我一樣❤️我也會把想說的和當時想像的全都畫下來，我給自己很長一段時間，我們都復活了🥹", "created_at": "2025-08-03T14:23:10", "owner": "jie.0117", "likes": 194}, {"id": 17975972537907286, "text": "加油❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-15T03:20:55", "owner": "0_shufen", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18098375770609639, "text": "女孩 妳超厲害 勝過所有 很支持妳", "created_at": "2025-08-06T03:40:12", "owner": "tsegoose_jw", "likes": 83}, {"id": 17916436596033261, "text": "我看到了 世界上最神奇的24堂課 讚", "created_at": "2025-08-05T03:35:20", "owner": "tc01690", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18090911824674813, "text": "女人 我敬佩妳！！🙏🏻 感謝妳依舊發光，願意把妳的經歷分享出來 幫助更多人", "created_at": "2025-08-14T08:09:05", "owner": "l________ainey.y", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18162839248369972, "text": "我也全中ww但可能當初才國小，我的大腦機制自己修復了自己（？）我變得很擅長遺忘喔XD雖然還是有點後遺症，比如把自己吃得胖胖的就很有安全感，直接從根源產生避免傷害的行為，現在除了工作跟買東西，一點都不想跟人產生連結，所有能在家做的嗜好我大部分都喜歡：）", "created_at": "2025-08-31T13:30:57", "owner": "lunanonono", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18054622778626236, "text": "稍微能理解最艱苦的心情 之前車禍被告知大機率只能恢復一半甚至不到 我一整年都反覆在崩潰跟鼓勵自己 一直有乾脆自殺的想法 但好險撐過來了 努力恢復到7成", "created_at": "2025-08-13T04:24:42", "owner": "ddddx._.0912", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848565124543912, "text": "这个世界没有什么是永恒的可以变坏，当然也能变好，而我们能做到的，只有一步-步努力地向前奔跑并坚信，前方的路一定可以达到。——丁程鑫", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:55:08", "owner": "nono.zhang.happy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17926587933069279, "text": "突然想念起我朋友，當初也是發生了點事情，去看醫生建議他寫點東西做些什麼，他寫著寫著看起來人好很多，但有一天卻收到訃聞說走了，原來他寫著的東西是如果這一切沒有發生他所希望的未來，有些傷看不出卻會拉著一個人陷在過去，珍惜關心身邊的人吧，RIP my friends願你所在之地沒有傷痛😢", "created_at": "2025-08-27T11:30:11", "owner": "s5781306", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17934269667106385, "text": "还有目前可以和ChatGPT聊天，也很有帮助。但是反反复复的，工作没有动力，人是憔悴的。身体是疼痛的。希望大家都能够走出来。", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:05:40", "owner": "may.rain_c", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18150749776390232, "text": "我也有過 我是男的", "created_at": "2025-08-03T02:46:41", "owner": "linyangrui.2002", "likes": 104}, {"id": 18062949491246458, "text": "讓我想到有個學生也是把自己的事件寫成書但她最後還是自殺了😔", "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:22:01", "owner": "youen0914", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844206919550526, "text": "辛苦了🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-09T12:22:30", "owner": "ytchen0111", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18518096956007101, "text": "沒事沒事～被性侵不是你的錯⋯勇敢的站出來發聲才是對自己負責。因為你越害怕欺負你的人就越得寸進尺", "created_at": "2025-08-05T06:53:26", "owner": "yaofeng.liu", "likes": 422}, {"id": 18082394231476447, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:08:22", "owner": "yx06_12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089156899907993, "text": "但我還沒 可是我想永遠你的方式 希望我做得到🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-19T15:20:52", "owner": "carry_0507", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078198703797823, "text": "我在评论区回怼了那些靠性器官思考的人(⁠ㆁ⁠ω⁠ㆁ⁠)", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:26:32", "owner": "xingyuexieying6", "likes": 39}, {"id": 17963523509957612, "text": "有愛滋就是另外一回事了.........", "created_at": "2025-08-18T08:22:21", "owner": "8495_nothing", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18005437208793795, "text": "開局地獄模式嗎…", "created_at": "2025-08-04T22:55:20", "owner": "peng0608", "likes": 110}, {"id": 17970125684978021, "text": "Strong women", "created_at": "2025-10-28T05:24:47", "owner": "zerilya_hamesu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18178156918358629, "text": "艺术家都是和普通人不一样的。而且我们是女生。遇到其他女生被强奸，我们更不能去嘲笑嘲讽。做人要有同情心。不是说没有发生在我们身上就可以去笑别人。因为这很恶毒。女生帮助女生天经地义。男生都不会好好对女生的。所以别害怕。也祈福全部女生被很好的对待。❤️🪷", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:01:49", "owner": "sroki1117_ig", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099224410670107, "text": "讲讲过程", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:24:50", "owner": "oji92883", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896297287281265, "text": "你只是想红被关注偏出来的故事", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:58:39", "owner": "djidjdkkg", "likes": 55}, {"id": 17997896246806848, "text": "受害者要用一輩子撫平傷痕…\n真的是很可悲的事", "created_at": "2025-08-09T09:45:31", "owner": "thewisforon", "likes": 355}, {"id": 18115288753551208, "text": "怎麼感覺你只是想靠這個博取流量啊\n不解", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:18:06", "owner": "skybusy123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907999162126766, "text": "我也想虐待你這麼可愛的", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:03:19", "owner": "qkqiakskfkdkfj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316568365215583, "text": "普通人很難享用了", "created_at": "2025-08-06T06:48:35", "owner": "test210617", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18055722452423530, "text": "🤢🤢easy mode to normal mode", "created_at": "2025-08-26T14:37:57", "owner": "horaceyiu333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896039521338897, "text": "问问一下被性侵后会恐惧男人吗？包括会恐惧性生活吗？", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:53:49", "owner": "4806.leon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182527753342459, "text": "加油！", "created_at": "2025-10-31T17:56:19", "owner": "jianhaolai8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881375899364711, "text": "嗯…我有一個朋友有相似的經歷 \n能不能請妳帶她走出來", "created_at": "2025-08-20T02:36:31", "owner": "yuan_01.13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948717841048464, "text": "可是我走不出來😢", "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:38:32", "owner": "emo03_08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858776374532512, "text": "好好享受就可以走出来了", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:17:09", "owner": "pankek9797", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17843243853551575, "text": "妳很誠實😍", "created_at": "2025-08-06T10:30:22", "owner": "ciao_xie_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17965191938951877, "text": "加油👏 你很棒🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-09T04:03:03", "owner": "weijianyap7687", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18083673352956862, "text": "我的話是感情一直受傷 目前單身 唉 想要女朋友 老婆啊", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:45:15", "owner": "ff7lfagtr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536243404044947, "text": "加油，妳很勇敢", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:27:09", "owner": "yumi.tasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074189773985498, "text": "這樣能交男朋友嗎？", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:32:14", "owner": "ji.yuan.66", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18537489868022458, "text": "好好享受就可以走出來了❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:35:52", "owner": "duyu.420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18540594475010150, "text": "是台湾人嘛 加油", "created_at": "2025-10-17T07:26:56", "owner": "timmy0704_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915311542036278, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-03T02:20:53", "owner": "jianfong516", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18065407793183823, "text": "🫵🏽👍🏽", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:52:35", "owner": "lil._.marky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051919661271277, "text": "能拯救自己的人，真的很不平凡！！加油", "created_at": "2025-09-22T02:32:36", "owner": "zp.c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075410114165633, "text": "真的要寫出來，那是一種很有幫助的抒發。妳好棒！", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:28:33", "owner": "hotmamee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961256751969896, "text": "我們得想辦法去解決這社會狀況😢\n不能一直漠視這種事情發生", "created_at": "2025-09-07T04:25:45", "owner": "e0124471125", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943570669032061, "text": "辛苦了，妳很棒❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-05T04:01:12", "owner": "loveoblivion", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17899875843268808, "text": "抱抱你（❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-16T12:44:13", "owner": "33.saving", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940037314055974, "text": "是的，錯的不是自己，而是這個骯髒的世界", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:28:24", "owner": "marcus_suen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071559206028063, "text": "加油✊", "created_at": "2025-08-20T12:38:51", "owner": "karseng_0730", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18521789020065204, "text": "你很勇敢🫂🫂慢慢走出來吧❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-31T22:57:04", "owner": "yiibi_201", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18382459186120780, "text": "一切都会好起来的❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-12T02:28:07", "owner": "jh_lim75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152232247384749, "text": "这就是爱自己的表现啦！👏❤️ 面对自己 接受自己 改变自己", "created_at": "2025-08-05T09:10:07", "owner": "howabtxh", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17913438303049663, "text": "真的很佩服😭也很感謝你 分享出來這真的很不容易！🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-12T11:26:10", "owner": "nun_nun_nuu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072096032044114, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-04T14:11:26", "owner": "528.tw", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053428724425719, "text": "加油加油🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-06T20:02:04", "owner": "ahlap_88", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18020615294541010, "text": "厲害👍🔥我是一直狂做事淡忘他😢", "created_at": "2025-08-08T08:07:16", "owner": "830630wakeup", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18024482996518822, "text": "我也是遇到 我13岁睡觉时 醒来发现我二哥(亲哥哥)在按我的胸", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:46:18", "owner": "hmeiy18_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054107747156422, "text": "辛苦了 加油🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-15T23:25:03", "owner": "7zykxxn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18349803172094174, "text": "加油，堅強的女孩不會輸🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-09T08:30:27", "owner": "yjl.1226", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860029504462776, "text": "🫡💪", "created_at": "2025-08-09T07:56:25", "owner": "b_ntl9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014630081759464, "text": "@wysh.123456", "created_at": "2025-08-09T10:31:03", "owner": "yclaizg084647", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18300050365219997, "text": "加油！", "created_at": "2025-08-05T05:07:37", "owner": "co_zhiyan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17916390381034796, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-08-06T03:42:38", "owner": "jdm0725", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17906107089209755, "text": "😢🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-06T17:26:48", "owner": "s._.w054", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860384662403078, "text": "你很棒，也很強大❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-06T08:37:03", "owner": "im.wen.ling", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038670035400839, "text": "😮😢👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-05T16:58:48", "owner": "zeno__b", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074145100817116, "text": "妹啊加油💪", "created_at": "2025-08-03T02:15:28", "owner": "b910158", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18006121655790375, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-03T00:08:54", "owner": "r8852p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054219872618541, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-04T20:38:56", "owner": "chen.milktea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900525898249219, "text": "加油🥲", "created_at": "2025-08-05T01:22:28", "owner": "nslc_jkl_1124", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858432703467508, "text": "😢加油！！", "created_at": "2025-08-05T04:43:24", "owner": "alex_momo_hk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956500038837999, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-05T05:53:44", "owner": "goofy.lin.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880454860363833, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-08-05T12:13:53", "owner": "ttkx1227", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988547106821997, "text": "加油👏沒問題的", "created_at": "2025-08-05T14:38:26", "owner": "_chang_yu_quan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001281131684584, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-05T18:15:52", "owner": "khlee489", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971760006915430, "text": "希望你可以渡過🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-05T20:46:08", "owner": "fatfatehawen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860563801454918, "text": "寶寶好厲害🥹🥹抱抱 這些年幸苦了", "created_at": "2025-08-06T01:53:00", "owner": "green.teacream_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073776010831113, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-06T01:51:57", "owner": "slyl2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18312659209243060, "text": "u r strong 😍", "created_at": "2025-08-06T02:59:42", "owner": "flyhng_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966004893941241, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-06T05:46:20", "owner": "h_wei_0807", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997283403654280, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-06T07:04:40", "owner": "did.1923", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844626637541830, "text": "一定会越变越好！🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-06T10:19:14", "owner": "nulizhuanmoney_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322029667227404, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-06T10:45:49", "owner": "shao__0226", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029263967767466, "text": "破繭重生 辛苦你了 加油", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:52:27", "owner": "dj6329new", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843844813639272, "text": "你很勇敢", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:36:28", "owner": "thee.0328", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090491611767072, "text": "所以傷害是可以慢慢變淡，但傷口還是會在對吧", "created_at": "2025-12-16T12:33:30", "owner": "liyuhong1528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274355308303266, "text": "好勇敢的女孩子", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:47:33", "owner": "dont_forget_my_double_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123565627535313, "text": "..加油", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:30:47", "owner": "gobi0085", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165427042381703, "text": "很厲害，分享給大家怎麼渡過，佩服你的勇敢🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:33:25", "owner": "bc.0813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399016072126811, "text": "謝謝妳的誠實面對沒有錯只是可以接納自己就已經很厲害了！妳沒有錯", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:19:47", "owner": "o_o__yu_jun_busy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843689155621747, "text": "你好犀利🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:38:50", "owner": "dilarclues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125348098506630, "text": "加油 那些人真的是畜生～只会伤害别人～", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:47:43", "owner": "jacklick_su0302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087649012756341, "text": "性侵犯該死🔥 勇敢的你很棒的❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:58:10", "owner": "gibson770202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090508688307880, "text": "辛苦了", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:27:26", "owner": "kevin.ken39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495735046075091, "text": "找人把性侵者宰了", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:53:17", "owner": "boyi_581", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18210737182311823, "text": "想知道具體怎麼樣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:58:06", "owner": "xdplay0717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033107795725308, "text": "拍拍我完全懂。。。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:32:07", "owner": "bias_yun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031639880725130, "text": "加油~我也經歷過 也打過官司 我知道很不容易:>但是還是祝你天天開心><", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:03:37", "owner": "7winr._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015730217792947, "text": "加油👏！！！", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:27:45", "owner": "shiva.0605__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364735627082376, "text": "辛苦了❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:10:23", "owner": "im87__598", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063278048160624, "text": "Proud of you", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:31:54", "owner": "lazysmart.irisl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093487030798640, "text": "你太棒了🥹❤️真的超棒，自己走出来真的超级强大", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:12:05", "owner": "candyshen2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047796590690377, "text": "加油 你很优秀！🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-01T07:14:15", "owner": "alexleafuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362267890092714, "text": "慢慢來其實比較快？", "created_at": "2025-11-01T00:11:32", "owner": "yunogg_10_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078525488158704, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-10-31T18:14:26", "owner": "wh.0315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064026683114776, "text": "你很勇敢 身为一个女人更不容易 加油", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:22:54", "owner": "damon_nice999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900071956300044, "text": "我還是說加油，雖然好像不太需要了🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:20:31", "owner": "xu.05.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122216725513292, "text": "你比起其他人更厲害\n相信被性侵是一件讓人受傷的一件事\n但你也能夠咬緊牙關堅持下去\n願你前途無可限量", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:35:46", "owner": "ilm_jabre.de_yil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165824305374880, "text": "持續做自己，不要被他人影響。👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:10:52", "owner": "blingbling0818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081609907845092, "text": "問！\n我也被性騷擾，要開庭了，要求償多少適合呢？", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:59:19", "owner": "noaman14911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947317128919301, "text": "加油🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:05:02", "owner": "yx_888_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498711082078581, "text": "勇敢能改變世界\n也許會受傷但更多意識到嚴重性\n你是受害者但也是英雄", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:49:55", "owner": "true821205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084015215303494, "text": "Sending hugs 辛苦了你真的很棒 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:59:24", "owner": "oceanl_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101579764726980, "text": "非常優秀", "created_at": "2025-10-27T01:58:09", "owner": "01234_.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076013603138578, "text": "真的很勇敢", "created_at": "2025-10-26T12:16:18", "owner": "tiantianelena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869376547457141, "text": "没事，一切都会好起来的", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:50:59", "owner": "nicolas.ng.1238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078716324515389, "text": "加油！👏", "created_at": "2025-10-24T12:45:13", "owner": "z_l5261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966737700972501, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:39:52", "owner": "xavier_xlzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362097040086238, "text": "那些臭雞雞，只會自己爽而已，防狼噴霧要隨身攜帶，必要時可以就自己一命。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:48:04", "owner": "fish01.31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045586562405799, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:07:00", "owner": "how_7171", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097717228667261, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T01:21:45", "owner": "kai___69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863384302498016, "text": "展开说说", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:05:15", "owner": "avoiddisturbances", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088006300906157, "text": "💪💪💪💪💪", "created_at": "2025-10-21T02:31:21", "owner": "kelvinlam969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093954022643097, "text": "你很棒了 還好你撐過去了 謝謝漂亮的你 讓自己得更耀眼更好", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:35:01", "owner": "sllllovylllls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057418721548011, "text": "评论区那堆检讨受害者和开一堆自以为幽默的弱智言论的废品啊你们是脑被谁摘了吗", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:10:57", "owner": "reussitesagesse", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17910882714248049, "text": "姊姊加油🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-20T10:52:59", "owner": "_ar0329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104038915624986, "text": "性侵你那條仆街冚家剷是誰？請開名", "created_at": "2025-10-20T07:29:40", "owner": "nowthis.soulution", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18245478034295971, "text": "美女你請律提告那些傷害妳的人", "created_at": "2025-10-20T07:16:44", "owner": "seaofasiaryn__2810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059198027567548, "text": "關於我成功成為《我獨自升級》內部的主角", "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:38:33", "owner": "1morst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000666299675690, "text": "我是侵犯者曾坐牢8年，我接受冶療知道自己過錯向你們道歉", "created_at": "2025-10-20T05:04:55", "owner": "kenji75408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887122432379918, "text": "我的朋友需要你这样的心态😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:03:52", "owner": "zhewei3073", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066883004587365, "text": "你很棒🔥希望你過得越來越好 加油", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:09:58", "owner": "solarway_1013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060391019430498, "text": "WOW 不知道說什麼 辛苦了 會越來越好的", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:56:52", "owner": "hojay520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081798134287082, "text": "朋友相信我，你並不孤單，這個社會多的是受傷但只能靠自己療癒自己的人，you're not alone ✊", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:09:00", "owner": "an_irisheyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947711557047871, "text": "你很棒 加油❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:33:45", "owner": "snsd1220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849009151578896, "text": "你很勇敢 加油🤍", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:27:03", "owner": "__rui0102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333944371230023, "text": "什麼也不說了 给妳一個溫暖的抱抱🫂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T04:31:14", "owner": "addams2864", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110390284585425, "text": "因为你生活一直少了和我在一起", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:04:33", "owner": "oneroadaroundtheworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539837752028696, "text": "承受如此大的壓力，還能夠自己走出來！真的很不簡單", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:09:37", "owner": "amg_0811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375935581196635, "text": "加油呀 姐姐超棒的🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:58:17", "owner": "z.sa_516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084079141798038, "text": "You r awesome !\nEverything gonna be alright !", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:07:45", "owner": "liar_iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069612794201515, "text": "辛苦妳了 一個人經歷這些真不容易", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:37:47", "owner": "mtw_.1026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068911121349835, "text": "姐姐加油！", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:26:10", "owner": "seahorse31_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853028656512425, "text": "\\(￣︶￣*\\))抱抱，别哭", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:53:42", "owner": "nono.zhang.happy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112923163559095, "text": "没关系！", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:53:28", "owner": "nono.zhang.happy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424876834109771, "text": "没怀孕就好", "created_at": "2025-10-13T17:08:12", "owner": "jw_baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170049790364840, "text": "真的很厲害很勇敢", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:44:18", "owner": "ryo_asami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081542083825638, "text": "姐姐超帅❤️🔥谢谢你让其他很多的人有了勇气！没人知道你熬得有多么辛苦 但是看到你不放弃就真的是太开心了", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:20:01", "owner": "kqwong3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099695332727078, "text": "加油🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:14:06", "owner": "juntay2621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061112735429008, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-10-10T21:05:54", "owner": "weiyee_0817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043436945678438, "text": "你好棒👍", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:18:23", "owner": "yixuan407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064713320377294, "text": "這些karma明明都應該是加害人要承受的", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:48:17", "owner": "nailsbittenbyme_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922493401146597, "text": "臺灣的話，推薦可以查查 暖暖 sunshine 🥰", "created_at": "2025-10-06T09:07:32", "owner": "haru.tw1128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986758002856732, "text": "車禍過，也是幾天後寫下來，才知道原來自己是這種情緒。沒寫的時候整個人是懵的、麻木的", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:09:13", "owner": "game_jingjing_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023754404554817, "text": "你好棒❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T12:54:51", "owner": "c_luna.1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895473538308290, "text": "你好勇敢👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-29T06:06:23", "owner": "mina.tseng.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045729869368877, "text": "你是最棒的， 一起去看看外面廣闊的世界❤️ 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:16:43", "owner": "llsky_rd_fvig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860511970490588, "text": "你真的很棒喔💗💗 給你一個雲端大抱抱🧚‍♂️👼", "created_at": "2025-09-25T03:07:34", "owner": "zhuanhuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094900009656976, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:54:09", "owner": "d224323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095754238580733, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-14T17:27:31", "owner": "cm_toh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994353270831776, "text": "你很棒一定会越来越好✨🦋", "created_at": "2025-09-14T00:25:41", "owner": "_yj616_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858378154500499, "text": "巴诺克 | 儿童乐园是全球化浪潮的黄金赛道\n\t\n当“亲子经济”成为跨国界的硬通货，儿童乐园已经成为了全球化浪潮中的黄金赛道🟡\n看看这组数据：北美家庭年均遛娃支出超8000美元，东南亚亲子乐园市场年增速37%，欧洲家长更愿为“教育型游乐”多付✔️\n👉🏻全球2000亿的市场缺口，藏着比你想象中更大的蛋糕🍰\n-\n巴诺克用全球化视野撕开赛道：STEM主题乐园让孩子边玩边学编程；全龄段运动矩阵成了多代人的社交中心；精品软包区+咖啡吧重新定义“遛娃格调”☕\n-", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:01:57", "owner": "gaoge5609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077145346825837, "text": "👍加油！時間不會癒合傷口只是淡忘！真正的重生是要面對它接受它放下它才是真正解脫重生！👍👏❤️👍👍", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:15:28", "owner": "visminoxu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075173977853893, "text": "好恐怖", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:18:19", "owner": "er.25671", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942317551059368, "text": "微信扫码赚钱一单RM0.5-10先到先得，要的来", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:11:00", "owner": "yiyima48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388319875192989, "text": "+1 慢慢來真都比較快", "created_at": "2025-09-10T02:15:50", "owner": "spr_big_hot_doggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064008011521103, "text": "重獲新生\n化繭成蝶\n祝福妳越來越好", "created_at": "2025-09-08T05:42:40", "owner": "79_23_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058045133379810, "text": "當時感覺如何", "created_at": "2025-09-08T01:49:10", "owner": "leidehen1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046417475326470, "text": "妳很棒加油", "created_at": "2025-09-07T17:38:40", "owner": "vip0314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045717047333785, "text": "可悲的災難，您很勇敢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:06:27", "owner": "hovietthao798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947432326023699, "text": "厉害厉害，加油👏", "created_at": "2025-09-05T05:18:21", "owner": "hou414741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909190591210282, "text": "先提告", "created_at": "2025-09-04T08:48:04", "owner": "ggininder146", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863357254461551, "text": "🫂🫂🫂", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:36:09", "owner": "coffeecat1226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854133100530535, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-03T08:12:22", "owner": "linn.alian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073447790014322, "text": "自己愛玩 好的男人不找 專找渣男", "created_at": "2025-09-01T18:43:48", "owner": "jiahong_uwub", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067517984335326, "text": "妳好棒🥹", "created_at": "2025-08-30T14:51:59", "owner": "alan____0826", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355731940083810, "text": "I need to make a video like this", "created_at": "2025-08-29T00:42:20", "owner": "thejoyyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962830902814314, "text": "妳好厲害，這世界讓妳遇到垃圾\n妳還是勇敢的讓自己度過了這個難關", "created_at": "2025-08-27T11:09:54", "owner": "ben_04_13", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18064598417225775, "text": "很棒", "created_at": "2025-08-25T01:37:03", "owner": "tim_xie0127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094595986642388, "text": "加油！", "created_at": "2025-08-25T01:23:02", "owner": "xjun_physio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978437973899454, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-08-24T17:02:35", "owner": "pin_rong_food_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888847987200516, "text": "辛苦妳了😢  去面對那些不應該承受的事已經很困難了…妳還浴火重生！！！甚至是分享自己如何蛻變🥹", "created_at": "2025-08-24T12:12:39", "owner": "nonentity__yi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288545017271220, "text": "加油 你会越来越好❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-24T10:49:02", "owner": "iamneil_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911527444191977, "text": "好厲害！", "created_at": "2025-08-23T18:19:10", "owner": "paul_cheng0603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090257713813330, "text": "妳真的很了不起，一路上獨自承受走過，願未來的妳更強大，祝福🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-23T16:23:59", "owner": "michaelai777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024490718718057, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏🫂", "created_at": "2025-08-23T10:54:55", "owner": "sophie_vn_tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968730855937580, "text": "🙏🙏加油", "created_at": "2025-08-22T17:11:04", "owner": "zx.13578", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893017936299226, "text": "Queen", "created_at": "2025-08-22T16:20:05", "owner": "ypc674", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927993750983859, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-22T15:39:29", "owner": "raphael19820219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069604025146961, "text": "加油加油！", "created_at": "2025-08-22T13:27:37", "owner": "a_peixi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937845457062373, "text": "辛苦了", "created_at": "2025-08-22T09:13:24", "owner": "lin.cold999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523080502050172, "text": "那個罪犯有沒有被大卸八塊，有沒有把他關在地下室，有沒有把他綁起來鞭個一萬下，然後再拿鹽酸澆他的🐔，這種人就不配活在這世界上", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:40:12", "owner": "tattoo_bo.sheng", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18409171624114484, "text": "算是有點緣------＞‘’內觀‘‘幫到你", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:24:23", "owner": "mademacau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131815834451117, "text": "上帝保佑🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-08-21T16:08:09", "owner": "jasonkramer_therapper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974898606914446, "text": "看來你大躍進了", "created_at": "2025-08-21T15:26:41", "owner": "superpassionmr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061928240522201, "text": "有才", "created_at": "2025-08-21T05:59:54", "owner": "jyang.63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956055396995146, "text": "世界上最神奇的24堂課\n真的很讚", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:27:59", "owner": "my881220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300188869247488, "text": "那本慢慢来，其实会更快，感觉是本不错的书", "created_at": "2025-08-21T02:00:17", "owner": "chanrencong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976943853870603, "text": "respect！", "created_at": "2025-08-21T01:20:28", "owner": "krs_yii03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071606455879366, "text": "💪💪", "created_at": "2025-08-20T11:04:55", "owner": "shiun_qq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128044060460385, "text": "加油 你很勇敢❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-19T10:18:24", "owner": "yxsk_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888736210338998, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-19T08:02:39", "owner": "thirteen.1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936097357064502, "text": "妳很棒", "created_at": "2025-08-19T06:52:30", "owner": "boyan.lu.98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037103834441060, "text": "非常的佩服，辛苦了，㊗️未來更順更美好🍬💫", "created_at": "2025-08-19T05:44:54", "owner": "lil.tazy99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073280626852791, "text": "昨天才看到遊戲別人id是 慢慢來其實比較快 當下看到真的覺得很有道理🫡", "created_at": "2025-08-18T04:45:04", "owner": "arl_514098", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532931491048928, "text": "真的很棒👏", "created_at": "2025-08-18T00:44:23", "owner": "stwbackop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056275037457219, "text": "你好厲害", "created_at": "2025-08-17T07:31:46", "owner": "igotta_lockin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079508158740159, "text": "加油 🙌 加害者才應該受苦", "created_at": "2025-08-17T01:00:28", "owner": "k047715801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108802201530066, "text": "🫂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T21:56:55", "owner": "iamnotmin_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036230237460569, "text": "敬佩🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-16T20:29:22", "owner": "joviwu10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070206467151252, "text": "把悲傷轉換是動力！妳是有智慧有力量的人🤍", "created_at": "2025-08-16T19:00:45", "owner": "zzz._________________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073104959113100, "text": "加油🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-16T18:51:41", "owner": "miko.leong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063712307005998, "text": "寶加油🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-16T15:20:55", "owner": "zheni5566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979406037890888, "text": "慢慢來，比較快。我完全明白😭", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:07:46", "owner": "manownlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034620368478558, "text": "謝謝你 你跟我的方法一樣，也是把想說的想打的，全部打在一起❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-16T12:06:55", "owner": "2018neeeeeew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041076989345012, "text": "被誰性侵", "created_at": "2025-08-16T08:38:10", "owner": "g_306785269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972963552921291, "text": "辛苦了。加油", "created_at": "2025-08-14T20:23:14", "owner": "love.liberty.yi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108240202545025, "text": "欸抖", "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:53:51", "owner": "_rrrraz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046961789294763, "text": "陪你面對陪你重生🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:05:52", "owner": "zi_yi_0703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061401842347619, "text": "👍把經歷轉成動力", "created_at": "2025-08-14T00:51:19", "owner": "endrancejji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080152270907811, "text": "Jay shetty🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-13T20:56:32", "owner": "cchung_1029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419098231099884, "text": "你很勇敢💪", "created_at": "2025-08-13T15:40:16", "owner": "elpida__thalassa814", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072192533032994, "text": "😍真可愛🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-13T14:39:47", "owner": "yide253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853334110510069, "text": "錯的是那個人，不是你自己", "created_at": "2025-08-13T14:02:12", "owner": "man1109._8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889380415321188, "text": "hi", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:01:19", "owner": "shuiyin_0705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069911243129777, "text": "💪💪💪💪💪", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:05:28", "owner": "ch86300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088021456783617, "text": "🫂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T16:38:22", "owner": "s.yourrong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063827170999388, "text": "一直以來辛苦了", "created_at": "2025-08-12T10:51:35", "owner": "mortal0930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068830625153482, "text": "時間似乎不能沖淡一切呢…", "created_at": "2025-08-12T08:05:58", "owner": "sakuramikochi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097060330621062, "text": "你很棒！！", "created_at": "2025-08-12T02:20:33", "owner": "churros_0867", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008663471789007, "text": "舉凡看到性侵或虐待，我是男生我都害怕，更想對你們說聲：不要加油，很累，但當你們想前進的時候，如果我有這份榮幸可以伸出手給予善意的祝福，我非常樂意！", "created_at": "2025-08-11T22:57:21", "owner": "ccc.cph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955049691848665, "text": "妳好棒！", "created_at": "2025-08-11T16:36:11", "owner": "iamannielin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037678088673903, "text": "雖然是不小心滑到這個影片的\n但我覺得妳很厲害\n也希望這世界的垃圾都消失\n沒有辦法想像 如果這件事發生在我家人身上🥲", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:23:05", "owner": "min_1.17", "likes": 57}, {"id": 17921476635129237, "text": "加油❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-11T06:48:29", "owner": "5niiyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012374972716868, "text": "與自己和解 這件事很漫長 也很辛苦 加油", "created_at": "2025-08-11T05:33:53", "owner": "kaquen_oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181106866331795, "text": "加油❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-11T04:53:37", "owner": "peng.0314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939612355025843, "text": "❤️❤️加油加油✨✨✨✨✨✨", "created_at": "2025-08-10T22:05:21", "owner": "jinkechang7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522170281061242, "text": "🙌🔥🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-10T17:21:30", "owner": "yy7891654", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980944644729219, "text": "能走出来很厉害，加油", "created_at": "2025-08-10T15:00:34", "owner": "xhy_0731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399858709142199, "text": "加油❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-10T14:22:35", "owner": "badu0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045866717313334, "text": "謝謝你走過來了。", "created_at": "2025-08-10T12:09:00", "owner": "pearl_studio.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051463967621397, "text": "你很棒❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:14:25", "owner": "yoze5920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153010681380068, "text": "加油，勇敢走出來是值得鼓勵。但亦希望了解你的故事，支持你。", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:08:37", "owner": "mau26099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065831318179986, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-10T10:01:52", "owner": "huangyichun_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084789328885710, "text": "你很勇敢 很漂亮 很強大\n會越來越好的❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-10T07:43:05", "owner": "ruru_j24687005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023872937723835, "text": "Akon 就是好聽😊", "created_at": "2025-08-10T06:29:36", "owner": "blendbe2b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063837776004136, "text": "願你接下來的日子❤️越來越勇敢🤗", "created_at": "2025-08-10T04:29:13", "owner": "nancy5486888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320055364239416, "text": "很勇敢的面對自己", "created_at": "2025-08-10T04:00:39", "owner": "god_ping", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107546992550641, "text": "辛苦妳了", "created_at": "2025-08-10T02:00:12", "owner": "b_o_h_o_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945467929040769, "text": "你超棒的😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-10T01:31:38", "owner": "_1126y__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047700281280538, "text": "這真的很厲害...\n身為重鬱加強迫患者雖然經歷不同 但很能明白那份痛楚 能夠有勇氣真的超屌", "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:22:52", "owner": "chengmin_0226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846532948540416, "text": "超棒超酷的!👊🥳", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:53:19", "owner": "xueronggg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370788613183208, "text": "Damn……😢😢", "created_at": "2025-08-08T09:46:40", "owner": "ccc_45078_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039400727658291, "text": "坚强的女生，希望你以后顺顺利利的😭😭😭一定要开心，要健康", "created_at": "2025-08-08T07:22:57", "owner": "claire221205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912371140053862, "text": "👏👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-07T22:19:25", "owner": "leejiaqing96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074579942485359, "text": "誰性侵你\n操他媽的\n我他媽拿五米長木棍 塞進去他屁眼", "created_at": "2025-08-07T18:20:17", "owner": "bear_is_me0124", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18379693927192179, "text": "“只要活着，就有希望。” ~史蒂芬·霍金", "created_at": "2025-08-07T18:10:57", "owner": "bik_kuang_min", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089128915742405, "text": "你很堅強👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻，辛苦你了", "created_at": "2025-08-07T15:39:20", "owner": "m_abelpo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009753536608651, "text": "加油！", "created_at": "2025-08-07T14:00:41", "owner": "good_boy_eno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18163107175365702, "text": "🔥🔥🙌加油  充满力量的你是最美丽的", "created_at": "2025-08-07T11:51:14", "owner": "chuiphoebe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859187146411833, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:53:48", "owner": "hto123qqww", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130537354449142, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:52:36", "owner": "arvin._.0316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926011609029031, "text": "太棒了加油加油❤️心態慢慢調整就會好起來雖然想到可能還是很難過害怕但我相信你只會越來越好 ❤️辛苦你了 感謝自己安慰自己對自己好點😍", "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:37:31", "owner": "l_i_n_930918", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931226118962412, "text": "加油！辛苦了", "created_at": "2025-08-07T09:27:41", "owner": "ning_shi_jiro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18352862434081135, "text": "加油💪希望你过得越来越好", "created_at": "2025-08-07T08:45:00", "owner": "junkiathow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049405778545455, "text": "⛽️加油💪", "created_at": "2025-08-07T08:30:13", "owner": "r95610701", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067229827923763, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-07T08:20:53", "owner": "l.annazz", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18122414923481892, "text": "加油鴨～～～我們大家一起加油～～～", "created_at": "2025-08-07T05:59:03", "owner": "donnie0501", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053031035178999, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-07T00:13:43", "owner": "tohsoonong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049702916544718, "text": "拍拍🥹", "created_at": "2025-08-06T23:21:04", "owner": "k_bum._.yu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052801634400318, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-08-06T22:31:51", "owner": "realkithauhau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942155905042521, "text": "加油 都會過去的❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-06T18:52:56", "owner": "meng_shuan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138272062422024, "text": "妳超棒的🙌🙌 鑽石到哪都發光", "created_at": "2025-08-06T17:27:42", "owner": "oldsu_0_0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065178725189922, "text": "希望性侵犯原地火化", "created_at": "2025-08-06T12:17:57", "owner": "deja2thevu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053655836573626, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-06T10:53:08", "owner": "dewhgf77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095600623620992, "text": "一起加油，我也走出来了", "created_at": "2025-08-06T06:53:31", "owner": "istunnedlikeabroccoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064044608210361, "text": "get rich", "created_at": "2025-08-06T04:43:02", "owner": "pceny1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111170443524195, "text": "有没有想过受害者的感受", "created_at": "2025-08-06T03:49:34", "owner": "hou.wong2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071745269117694, "text": "殺", "created_at": "2025-08-05T11:27:54", "owner": "nestfirst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298568296247315, "text": "要感到羞恥的不是受害者，是罪犯！", "created_at": "2025-08-05T11:03:21", "owner": "sha_du_du", "likes": 4360}, {"id": 18066783184942141, "text": "me too 一起加油", "created_at": "2025-08-05T05:49:42", "owner": "rung5632024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101394655600319, "text": "WTF", "created_at": "2025-08-05T05:02:05", "owner": "lyjack55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403422850115529, "text": "so?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T04:16:15", "owner": "niggamnbvcxz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034586792475249, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-08-05T04:11:46", "owner": "chenjason0602", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040421813643614, "text": "加油🫂", "created_at": "2025-08-05T03:58:07", "owner": "hea_lun_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039924404362162, "text": "昨天的傷痛已死，幸福快樂就在當下❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-05T00:02:17", "owner": "jiangpaipai85", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051957218190561, "text": "打爆那個人的頭 應該會好一點", "created_at": "2025-08-04T17:40:16", "owner": "0113__fk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18474423586073091, "text": "加油～加油～ 🔥辛苦了", "created_at": "2025-08-04T14:15:19", "owner": "mao_2750", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18470492920074270, "text": "除了加油，沒別的可以說，平安健康", "created_at": "2025-08-03T08:54:13", "owner": "wangwenkai387", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18038688902385167, "text": "加油😢😢😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-03T08:20:54", "owner": "kurage3366", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17870889624410021, "text": "🌹🌹🌹", "created_at": "2025-08-03T04:25:07", "owner": "gavinchan66", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18101885806576207, "text": "辛苦了，加油", "created_at": "2025-08-03T03:53:27", "owner": "staricerabbit", "likes": 6}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
