"2025-12-18T09:44:46", "owner": "sofiatrinchini", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18002365922835766, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:00:11", "owner": "danielcorralesmoreno", "likes": 397}, {"id": 18061312841252294, "text": "Der Kameramann hat einen richtig guten Job gemacht", "created_at": "2025-12-18T07:11:22", "owner": "noahh.bta", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17951529180061082, "text": "Wild", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:50:55", "owner": "littlelegs_racer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071333117605870, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:18:28", "owner": "passionr1der", "likes": 164}, {"id": 18517958593064173, "text": "Der Bruder hat sich einfach selbst überfahren 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T00:43:33", "owner": "fabian_j99", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18074476247585461, "text": "Also perfekt im Krankenwagen 👀", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:04:47", "owner": "40th_zx10_rider", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18145461175451708, "text": "Your type is asking you what your type is", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:14:54", "owner": "jammayfmx", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18113135302609542, "text": "6 trend in 1", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:15:04", "owner": "niccolostettler", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864725191454322, "text": "Team Blondes 👱‍♀️❤️♾️", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:15:18", "owner": "_davejr88_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063591875226672, "text": "Foi atropelado pela própria moto kkkkkkkkk", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:41:59", "owner": "samukael03", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18137594350472056, "text": "👀🫣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:10:19", "owner": "jezzvonsperling", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18038533196708813, "text": "Bro knows ball🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:28:06", "owner": "maggostunt_official", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857081344576264, "text": "Even as the bike was riding him, I really thought he was gonna pull off a sick trick back onto it 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:06:49", "owner": "coral_polyps", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065051153406413, "text": "Blondinen auf die 1 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:09:25", "owner": "nico.ta.93", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030844961563716, "text": "My blood type? Owwwww positive", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:56:04", "owner": "tomaatcrevette1234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089553514777995, "text": "Liking for the plot twist", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:12:17", "owner": "woneinamillion", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074823713337710, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:41:41", "owner": "kalinskiya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18160376533363048, "text": "Hat dein Bike dich einfach überfahren?😭😭 Das war persönlich", "created_at": "2025-12-17T16:58:59", "owner": "diese_kim", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17850742707608802, "text": "Blue eyes", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:35:42", "owner": "hylasmunoz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031410674758630, "text": "My algorithm knows me to a fault. I’m screwed.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:41:06", "owner": "shutter_speed27", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092770369820824, "text": "@riki_sorghi", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:38:08", "owner": "marcooceccato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18218612662307959, "text": "Camera man on point 😂🫡", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:15:50", "owner": "r1moto_mo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18383974096148484, "text": "@makkus_88", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:02:53", "owner": "b.en_232", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990515331743203, "text": "🫩💔", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:16:42", "owner": "jasy_030", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877306495445566, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:20:15", "owner": "vincevegeta", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18121917211551814, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:37:51", "owner": "cahitakbulut", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17960200031880403, "text": "Gute Besserung 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-17T22:47:07", "owner": "bjarnestuntbuddy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18118499695599982, "text": "bro hed sich selbst überfahri", "created_at": "2025-12-17T14:31:38", "owner": "sleep.deprived.ivane", "likes": 305}, {"id": 18097853944882213, "text": "Based", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:03:30", "owner": "odal.tyr88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087711613823467, "text": "Saben a cereza¡", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:04:23", "owner": "xsafarish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18545654932047074, "text": "@max.rossi 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:13:03", "owner": "shmadsyodad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076401182002918, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:36:31", "owner": "yosef_biton325", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066515363452048, "text": "Brunette>", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:51:31", "owner": "pedrorcgomes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115215061514795, "text": "Kumpel hat sich selbst überfahren😂😂 Respekt....kriegt nicht jeder hin🤣🙈", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:58:15", "owner": "stiewe_ls6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859637059561502, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:34:31", "owner": "bsz.parts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950904820064539, "text": "😂😂 I hope I don’t have to get hurt just to admit I prefer blondes 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:41:28", "owner": "rcosta.adv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097508221893900, "text": "To answer them „you“ would be enough tough", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:45:15", "owner": "timmy_maxx_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086153158845583, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:08:08", "owner": "gerhard_domm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842659393659922, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:10:48", "owner": "rahulsiinghhh", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18097391968851052, "text": "Träume mal weiter deine feuchten Träume 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:03:41", "owner": "kubii_2000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082820345037750, "text": "The doctors wanted to tell you that you would die in 10 minutes if they didn't get you blood.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:22:04", "owner": "benjodrez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18121351636557482, "text": "Bro hat sich selbst überfahren und sah dabei noch cool aus!😭😭😂🏆", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:38:21", "owner": "wolfblood.woman", "likes": 66}, {"id": 17992631846907234, "text": "Hahaha geil junge 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:25:10", "owner": "keinert_03", "likes": 45}, {"id": 17876546928450587, "text": "Und dann auch noch so ein Glück im Krankenwagen 😂😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:09:01", "owner": "nick_remedy", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18167380849389278, "text": "Them: “Who ran over the top of you?!?” \nMe: “I did…” 😳😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:07:32", "owner": "smyth787", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17983970126923181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:30:34", "owner": "philipp_mht", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18116801698501861, "text": "Guter Geschmack 😂😂😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:48:29", "owner": "baki_36", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137107645475201, "text": "Haha did u do that on purpose, the nurses might be blonde? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:50:16", "owner": "jaakkothegreat", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17988409385749677, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:54:42", "owner": "kecco_boggio", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18014099570809647, "text": "Turned into a chiropractor real fast 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:43:51", "owner": "cbr4rider", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056312678668365, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T16:14:26", "owner": "tobimrd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18097073494878869, "text": "AHAHAHHAHA", "created_at": "2025-12-17T23:38:20", "owner": "yasminstetter_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18076449229991314, "text": "😂🤝", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:23:31", "owner": "mk__686", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081442336901753, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T06:03:34", "owner": "ron.smr_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18098032177859123, "text": "That is lot of dedication to be run over by your own motorcycle", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:33:05", "owner": "artistly20_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17937545280104747, "text": "Fire😁", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:06:08", "owner": "borna_cvajo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18116611705574350, "text": "i am at point where i would take anything that has a hole", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:34:00", "owner": "trjzf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053370206660334, "text": "I think your type was in the ambulance 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:09:22", "owner": "zacharyingr933", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17903320953331666, "text": "Awesome", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:07:59", "owner": "moonlightdrawer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843347383645464, "text": "So i have to get thrown off my bike for the next video? Got it 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:59:28", "owner": "nightfurym2", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18189383548344338, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:42:37", "owner": "victorr_46", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060605582271698, "text": "Lol I told the butch emt my type was \"born female, looks female\"", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:08:34", "owner": "i65exit347", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994220913898743, "text": "Vom eigenem Moped überfahren zu werden ist krass 😅👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:28:53", "owner": "danius_bklf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997415466849749, "text": "Das hat er doch extra gemacht 😃", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:21:56", "owner": "coyote.6969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984158121927131, "text": "Geisteskrankes Video wow", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:31:57", "owner": "701.michiii", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18107742556567456, "text": "In f… house slippers 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:01:14", "owner": "kallifavorit818_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954423472047719, "text": "lol", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:48:00", "owner": "hennryjadams", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098650540893740, "text": "WTF?!🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:08:36", "owner": "martin_kotyza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015931868800686, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:08:36", "owner": "daniele_zanirato", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368164999095109, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:01:12", "owner": "carstens_mk7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115992793603989, "text": "Bro was involved in a hit and run and was the hit and the hitter 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:53:23", "owner": "jifitness21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102310690753441, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:12:42", "o