859734, "text": "Ambulances don't carry blood", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:16:43", "owner": "dtw0052025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318060880220339, "text": "My type", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:00:23", "owner": "adrianseron32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988154121868610, "text": "\"Wie konnte das passieren?\" \"Ich habe mich selbst überfahren\"", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:51:30", "owner": "pand_amouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080712166925568, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:42:21", "owner": "kenta1089", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114561313605837, "text": "Why didnt he die? 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:38:28", "owner": "ivilsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063716705228735, "text": "Wheel 0 , front flip 10 ! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:15:52", "owner": "arkrolmotor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542103586059999, "text": "You mean brunettes that dye their hair", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:56:22", "owner": "m0daf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849184819587417, "text": "my guilty pleasure 🤟😔", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:21:41", "owner": "cristian_29011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028280927716773, "text": "Oh man😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:36:01", "owner": "ur_type._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067783943432652, "text": "Dommage pour les brunes ...👀", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:22:56", "owner": "lounaa.rcii.reel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050522351418604, "text": "Can't relate. I like brunettes", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:08:22", "owner": "_carlaum_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927770683184997, "text": "Brunettes clear", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:00:03", "owner": "artiom.shulyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896114563224193, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:54:56", "owner": "fettamon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142312093461564, "text": "run yourself over 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:21:47", "owner": "jjkb7774", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032763314536294, "text": "@j4_pogo_fatso 這我", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:32:27", "owner": "benbenbenyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002577023835244, "text": "😂🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:12:33", "owner": "shiftsix_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905682256316704, "text": "Können wir darüber reden wie er sich einfach selbst überfahren hat?😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:08:09", "owner": "xavermann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100524088789619, "text": "Blondes It’s our time to shine 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:44:33", "owner": "katy_ann_smith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902150794339440, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:38:42", "owner": "thibaud_bldz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093130442502302, "text": "Need a video on curly hair with glasses🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:19:50", "owner": "ashangbou_chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853778278554250, "text": "They don’t want you bro 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T07:02:51", "owner": "yurrae.cx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085977020101990, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:36:04", "owner": "ezekiel_ayye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107861530630462, "text": "Damm this is what I call quality content 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:20:39", "owner": "doctorpov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107761171639941, "text": "🤎", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:08:28", "owner": "marcel.zxtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104391016670738, "text": "She has to be extremely melanin-challenged", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:02:10", "owner": "the.collins.lagat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892911229245587, "text": "Dibalik kesusahan ada kebaikan reall udh😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:48:21", "owner": "kevinrahmatullah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115362250571824, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:47:49", "owner": "_oliver.pl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931012075018097, "text": "Afff", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:44:04", "owner": "hennypvt1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544667221037324, "text": "I mean brunette is mine", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:35:25", "owner": "fireberrytech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544033648050695, "text": "Warum nicht brunetten😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:31:14", "owner": "bikerwoman472", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011870906813785, "text": "Bro got his wish 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:02:54", "owner": "robert0hill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051442652386170, "text": "Hear me out, blondes,  brunettes or redheads?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:53:23", "owner": "escape.plan.insiders", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185756752354120, "text": "Ufff🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:41:20", "owner": "blazfemia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094889393492024, "text": "Being ran over by your own bike club member 🥂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:15:44", "owner": "mr_ludus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975039438962396, "text": "HIDUP BLONDEEEE 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:13:07", "owner": "lauuwudee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060849455262652, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:02:26", "owner": "elusive_morningstar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970344723976871, "text": "If teddy rinner had wheels he would be a bike", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:56:35", "owner": "seb_olip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390188695183070, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:43:36", "owner": "_ngsantoss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918988165213579, "text": "Imagine being able to say you ran yourself over", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:42:36", "owner": "ben__sweeny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109698139715539, "text": "Latinas>", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:41:55", "owner": "matthewl600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108012175564130, "text": "It’s your lucky day, besides the little motorcycle debacle. I see 2 blondes who may even cut your clothes off later, idk. ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:04:02", "owner": "onewheel.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051404306402209, "text": "Bro ran himself over", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:02:11", "owner": "joey_s4_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146845987453639, "text": "My blood type is A+ Blonde! 😍😍😅", "created_at": "2025-12-19T02:44:24", "owner": "ryanvz98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076792076210953, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-12-19T02:12:00", "owner": "c_gnascimento88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870035683490957, "text": "Of course", "created_at": "2025-12-19T02:09:33", "owner": "_gavinwiener", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088296059287064, "text": "sue himself", "created_at": "2025-12-19T02:03:34", "owner": "lowcielva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093215890730960, "text": "Good news! I'm a perfect match if you need a donor.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:50:44", "owner": "boominsvx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862221190553508, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:45:21", "owner": "lsdanny7x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893356135240536, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:28:09", "owner": "michael_gassner96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846864199601791, "text": "Yo viendo como el mismo tipo que se gasta mi dinero también me atropello :)", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:22:04", "owner": "gael6028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368170660095858, "text": "Bro got blessed with the paramedics", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:18:13", "owner": "w7ll7am7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083443574030631, "text": "Not my type, but funny", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:51:53", "owner": "mjmnz_xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051088472401295, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:30:52", "owner": "eddyrodriguez714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398251006124042, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:37:31", "owner": "black_4gts_travel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106142776710568, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:57:37", "owner": "soeren__menke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087981394998587, "text": "That was satisfying", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:34:03", "owner": "quigley_ash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176848789370483, "text": "Definitely me", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:18:12", "owner": "dimitris.bkg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086333579073996, "text": "It was so well done that you would have thought it was planned", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:00:24", "owner": "plusdepseudoinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996434772845967, "text": "Deswegen immer mit vollkombie fahren, egal wie krass der SKills ist"