g at Meta", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:57:44", "owner": "dube.szn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087533792499144, "text": "Exposing your self online ❌ exposing yourself to meta employees ✅", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:27:49", "owner": "matthewisanchez", "likes": 5655}, {"id": 18081212663160391, "text": "Meta: This data will be used for training & RESEARCH purposes 🌚", "created_at": "2025-12-18T07:46:31", "owner": "casually.shubham", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18054017348302072, "text": "*runs to Google to search ‘leaked Meta glasses footage’*", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:43:21", "owner": "frerkingphoto", "likes": 128}, {"id": 17965667066984641, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T20:26:57", "owner": "rodeodriveby", "likes": 3298}, {"id": 18102490003631187, "text": "Your FBI agent getting a free show", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:47:06", "owner": "imtimmahler", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18067722443376720, "text": "Voluntarily adding your naked body to zuccs fap folder is wild", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:07:15", "owner": "dillanxwhite", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18118241020553219, "text": "@meta we know you have it saved just send it to us please 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:01:53", "owner": "web.dev.peter", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18310500142161963, "text": "Is Zuck watching this or not?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:24:24", "owner": "athulvstheworld", "likes": 81}, {"id": 18293577250283239, "text": "“Your post has been uploaded to Facebook”", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:36:45", "owner": "hpisgnarly", "likes": 755}, {"id": 18103731784623309, "text": "Mark Zuckerburg busy gooning on the other end😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:08:07", "owner": "lewiscius", "likes": 2163}, {"id": 17847624573605782, "text": "your conch piercing looks so healthy and perfectly placed sorry piercing brain never goes away", "created_at": "2025-12-17T22:38:33", "owner": "cammieluvr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100874263696366, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:23:55", "owner": "from_da_h00d", "lik